      "content": "The silence you seek right now is not permanent stillness but a terrifying gap where the world fades away entirely, which is why I must ask you to keep fighting just a little longer for one more moment. When the pressure of being \"fixed\" becomes too heavy, please call 988 not to perform for anyone, but simply because you deserve someone to sit with you in the dark without asking for anything back. Your desire to rest does not mean you are broken; it only means your love for life has worn out due to a world that demands too much from so much of you.",
